{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14709","headline":"酬白乐天刘梦得 · 冯宿","name":"酬白乐天刘梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共称洛邑难其选，何幸天书用不才。\n遥约和风新草木，且令新雪静尘埃。\n临岐有愧倾三省，别酌无辞醉百杯。\n明岁杏园花下集，须知春色自东来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯宿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}